  "goodToKnow": "Der Forst is a forest that is managed and used for timber, as opposed to der Wald, the general word. Der Förster looks after it, and die Forstwirtschaft is forestry. A Forsthaus is a forester's house, and Forst is also a town in Brandenburg. Many German forests are managed Forst, planted to be harvested."
